  "name": "Cloud Mind",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 15th level, you can cause others to become unaware of your existence. Once per short rest, you may force all creatures within range of your aura to make a Wisdom saving throw, or else you become Hidden to them. If you activate any class features, cast a spell, activate a magic item or make an attack, this effect automatically ends, and if you interact with the environment in a noticeable way, they may attempt the saving throw once more. This effect lasts for ten minutes, or until you end your turn with them outside your aura.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
